      {
        "purpose": "通过代数联立方程推导空间交线与投影圆方程，明确高度 h 对半径 r 的决定作用以及坐标高度保留差异",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "我们来探讨如何从方程读懂三维曲面的几何特征。对于曲面方程 z等于x平方加y平方，我们将通过固定输出高度 z等于h，联立两个代数方程来分析曲面在不同高度上的截面特征。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\begin{cases} z = x^2 + y^2 \\\\ z = h \\end{cases} \\implies x^2 + y^2 = h"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 4
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "\\begin{cases} z = x^2 + y^2 \\\\ z = h \\end{cases} \\implies x^2 + y^2 = h \\implies r = \\sqrt{h}"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "聚焦代数方程组的联立与求解过程",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  },
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 4
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "对比平面圆的标准方程 x平方加y平方等于r平方，可以发现，当 h 大于 0 时，联立方程在二维平面上的解集形式是一个半径 r 等于 根号h 的圆。请特别注意：h 决定的是半径的平方，而不是半径本身。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "x^2 + y^2 = r^2 \\implies r = \\sqrt{h} \\quad (h > 0)"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 1,
                  "item": 4
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "我现在把截面高度 h 从 1 动态调整到 4，请注意观察空间截线与平面投影圆的变化关系。虽然截面高度升到了 4，但投影圆的半径是从 1 增加到了 2。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 4,
                "duration_intent": "extended",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "对比空间中的截线和平面上的投影圆：空间截线上的所有点坐标为 (x, y, h)，其圆心位于空间中的 (0, 0, h)；而 xy 平面上的投影圆抛弃了高度信息 z，仅保留坐标 (x, y)，圆心位于平面原点 (0, 0)。",
            "delivery": "careful",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "对比空间截线点坐标与平面投影点坐标的区别",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  },
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 4
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "最后，我们讨论高度 h 的代数边界：当 h 等于 0 时，方程退化为 x平方加y平方等于0，截面缩为单一原点 (0,0)；当 h 小于 0 时，由于实数平方和非负，方程无实数解，表明曲面在 z小于0 的区域没有分布。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "h = 0 \\implies (0,0); \\quad h < 0 \\implies \\varnothing"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
